      "side": 1,
      "message": "Originally, this was a generic register file for all stm32 chips, some of which could have had 8 channels for DMA. As such, our enum convention is to assume all eight channels map to a single controller. It is up to the implementer to use only channels available on the chip in question. This means we can always modulo by 8 to reach the second DMA in dma.c",
